# A SoundFont is a licence question, and this repository answers it for exactly
# one: `assets/soundfont.sf2`, which `NOTICE` accounts for. The pattern stays
# for every other one, because a bank somebody drops in to try is a bank nobody
# has established this project may redistribute — TimGM6mb was GPL-2.0 under an
# MIT OR Apache-2.0 tree and reached `assets/` the same way.
assets/*.sf2
!assets/soundfont.sf2
